{"status":"completed","summary":"OpenSSH on node1 is hardened and persistent. Only ssh-access members can authenticate with public keys; root, contractor, and password authentication are denied. The ssh-admin firewalld zone permits SSH solely from node2, while node3 is blocked. Prepared accounts, keys, and data survived sequential reboots of all three nodes.","actions_performed":["Installed and activated a validated OpenSSH hardening drop-in on node1.","Created the persistent ssh-admin zone bound to node2/32 and removed SSH from the active public zone.","Verified strict, pinned, non-interactive sshprobe access as opsadmin.","Verified live rejection of root, contractor, password authentication, and node3 network access.","Restarted node1, node2, and node3 individually and verified changed boot identities and full recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Public-key-only access for ssh-access; root, contractor, and password authentication denied","command_ids":["cmd-a1f4cc839dc44b99","cmd-5ce9ad5ca7bf4b5c"],"summary":"Final effective sshd policy and live post-restart attempts prove the required authentication controls."},{"requirement":"Pinned non-interactive sshprobe access from node2 to opsadmin","command_ids":["cmd-e523348547284ff7","cmd-3044d772df5a4315","cmd-29389e19ecb8462a","cmd-5ce9ad5ca7bf4b5c"],"summary":"The authorized/client key fingerprints match, node1 host keys remain pinned, and strict BatchMode access succeeds after all restarts."},{"requirement":"Dedicated ssh-admin jump-box boundary and node3 denial","command_ids":["cmd-a1f4cc839dc44b99","cmd-5ce9ad5ca7bf4b5c","cmd-e57d67b7f74d4ab9"],"summary":"Runtime and permanent policy bind SSH to node2 through ssh-admin; node2 succeeds and node3 receives a network-layer rejection."},{"requirement":"Prepared accounts, keys, and data preserved","command_ids":["cmd-386200ab98c24cd1","cmd-6a2454d8a53a4d81","cmd-a1f4cc839dc44b99","cmd-236066d0146240ad"],"summary":"Pre/post hashes, fingerprints, ownership, permissions, account membership, and live data access remain unchanged."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-4292782ca5da46e9","cmd-0ef71535565f4231","cmd-2588c6dfc99a4b80","cmd-eac16f4be473464e","cmd-374afbcf230b451b","cmd-cd2ceb08ceee4ff8"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from c2f29441-0515-4717-99f7-a7647824278d to 943c739c-f994-4811-8aab-8969eac9b106; services, policy, data, allowed access, and denials recovered."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node2 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-6a2454d8a53a4d81","cmd-c016bccecf8142f2","cmd-9232c505d30e48e5","cmd-236066d0146240ad"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from e65e6bcf-e09d-42b7-8317-cb6310086cb7 to 32e86545-f69d-4006-a256-a1b525741f5d; sshprobe material and strict access recovered."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node3 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-10f61354590f4f13","cmd-80925e7254e041f8","cmd-a4f6dca6aa374969","cmd-f05e35b06e834056"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from 54089086-53d1-408b-a22f-57b1dea70e03 to 4c2798ff-fc69-4591-a0c6-9b0273ab6f24; networking recovered while SSH access to node1 remained blocked."}]}
